	<string>Listen for the Isher or Aisha wake word on the Home screen and record voice messages for your business team chat.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Recognize the Isher or Aisha wake word and your Chat or Call choice while the Home screen voice assistant is enabled.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Take product photos to create promotional posters in ISHER Creative Studio.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Select photos to share with your business team in chat.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Save sales receipt images to your photo library.</string>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Choose a customer contact when sharing an invoice or business document.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Use your approximate location to show today's local weather in the business brief.</string>
</dict>
</plist>
